340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 302 0 R
/E (Climate change is a long-term change in weather)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
341 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 302 0 R
/E ( patterns caused mainly by human activities, such as burning fossil fuels, cutting down forests, and industrial processes. These actions lead to global warming, which results in major changes to weather, rising sea levels, and damaging ecosystems. These changes threaten food production, water availability, health, and people's lives, especially in poorer countries and developing regions. To tackle this issue, the international community created Sustainable Development Goal 13 \(SDG 13\), called "Climate Action." This goal focuses on urgent efforts to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and protect vulnerable communities from the impacts of climate change. Climate action involves various strategies to adapt to and mitigate the effects of climate change, aiming for a more sustainable and resilient future. Our project will look into the main problems and challenges in climate action, finding gaps that need to be addressed. We will propose innovative and effective solutions across different sectors and levels. Additionally, we plan to create a C++ program to calculate carbon footprints, which will be a useful tool for supporting climate action efforts.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
